{{#step}}
Create the first admin of the production database, before the Worker is reachable: Payload lets the first visitor create a user while the users collection is empty, and a deployed Worker has a public address. Put the email and a password of at least 12 characters in `apps/web/.env.admin` (`ADMIN_EMAIL` and `ADMIN_PASSWORD`), then run the command. It does nothing once a user exists.

   ```bash
   {{runScript "ensure-admin:remote"}}
   ```
{{/step}}
